ATTRIBUTION

This project adapts the relation set, the scrambling ideas and the phrasing
conventions of Syllogimous v3 by 4skinSkywalker
(https://github.com/4skinSkywalker/Syllogimous-v3), which is released under
CC BY-NC 3.0. The non-commercial term is carried over from that work.

The n-back delay mechanic, the interface, and all source code in this
repository were written independently for this project.

If you later decide the code here is separable from the upstream work, you are
of course free to relicense your own contributions.
